    <string name="linux_setup_heading">Debian 13 for HandTop</string>
    <string name="linux_setup_intro">HandTop will download the official Debian 13 (trixie) image from Docker Hub (about 30 MB) and unpack it on the phone (about 100 MB). You get a real Linux terminal with apt — no root needed.</string>
